Package: libva-v4l2-rk3399
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: VA-API driver for the Rockchip RK3399 video engine
 libva-v4l2 backed by V4L2 memory-to-memory devices, with H.264 encode
 through the VPU2 and H.264/HEVC/VP9 decode through RKVDU on the RK3399.
 The encoder path also provides a VA video processor (VAProfileNone /
 VAEntrypointVideoProc) that converts packed RGB frames to the NV12
 surfaces the VPU2 takes.
 .
 Install the matching hantro-vpu-rk3399 kernel module package for the
 encoder node to exist.
